Pal Guitar Chords with strumming pattern from Bollywood Hindi movie Jalebi sang by Arijit Singh and Shreya Ghoshal.

Strumming Pattern: D D UDUD D

[Gm] [F] [D#] [Cm] [Gm]

[Gm] [F] [D#] [F] [Gm]

(Hmm…)

[Gm]Pal ek [F]pal mein hi [D#]tham sa [F]gaya

[Gm]Tu haath [F]mein haath [D#]jo de gaya

Chalun main jahaan [Gm]jaaye tu

Daayein main tere, [Dm]baayein tu

Hoon rut main, [F]hawayein tu

[Cm]Saathiya

Hansu main jab [Gm] gaaye tu

Roun main murjha [D#]aye tu

Bheegun main bars [F]aaye tu

Sa [Cm]athiya [Dm]…

